  finding_lifecycle_events: { category: "E", userRefColumns: ["actor_user_id"], piiRisk: "low", rlsStatus: "enabled", specialHandling: "NEW (finding-lifecycle C6). APPEND-ONLY per-finding two-axis lifecycle event stream (immutability triggers, 20260901), mirroring risk_lifecycle_events. Org-scoped (organization_id NOT NULL); RLS enabled from creation (NOT FORCE, inert until app_request flip). actor_user_id ON DELETE SET NULL. Written in-tenant-tx by findingLifecycle.ts (operational recompute + guarded decision transitions). Tier B (SELECT+INSERT)." },
